  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shiraka Training Programme Energy Transition 202</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this annual course is for civil servants and relevant semi-public organisations working in the field of energy transition to share their knowledge and skills, enabling them to lead and inspire the energy transition in their home countries, communities and cities. Every year the training focusses on a topic related to the climate table. The course also aims to strengthen participants&apos; ties with the Netherlands and stakeholders in the Dutch energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
